<p>
  You are welcome to bring one adult support person to your scan. For health,
  safety and privacy reasons, we prefer that children do not attend appointments.
</p>
<p>If a child must attend:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Only one child may attend.</li>
  <li>The child must be supervised by another adult who is not the patient.</li>
  <li>Children must not be left unattended in the waiting room.</li>
  <li>
    If a child becomes unsettled during the examination, the accompanying adult
    may be asked to take them outside the examination room.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  For longer or more detailed examinations, we strongly recommend making other
  childcare arrangements where possible.
</p>
